    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <description><![CDATA[## What is Cherry Studio?

Cherry Studio is an AI productivity studio for the desktop: chat, autonomous agents
and more than 300 ready-made assistants, with unified access to the major LLM
providers and local models.

## Usage

The package installs the Cherry Studio desktop app. Start it from the Start Menu and add
the model providers you use.
]]></description>
    <summary>AI productivity studio with chat, autonomous agents and 300+ assistants</summary>
